<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content="{description}">
    <script type="application/jay-data" contract="./page.jay-contract"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../styles/theme.css" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
      /* ── Shared ── */
      .section { padding: 96px 0; }
      .section-label {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 500;
        line-height: 16px;
        color: var(--color-primary);
        letter-spacing: 0.4em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .text-muted { color: var(--color-text-muted); }
      .text-primary { color: var(--color-primary); }
      .text-center { text-align: center; }

      .glass-panel {
        background: rgba(10, 15, 30, 0.7);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        border: 1px solid rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.1);
        transition: border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
      }
      .glass-panel:hover {
        border-color: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.3);
        box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05);
      }

      /* ── Header ── */
      .site-header {
        position: fixed;
        top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
        z-index: 50;
        background: rgba(14, 19, 34, 0.7);
        backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.2);
      }
      .header-inner {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        max-width: var(--max-width);
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 16px var(--margin-mobile);
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .header-inner { padding: 16px var(--margin-desktop); }
      }
      .header-brand {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 32px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        color: var(--color-primary);
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .header-nav {
        display: none;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 32px;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .header-nav { display: flex; }
      }
      .header-nav a {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: color 0.3s;
      }
      .header-nav a:hover { color: var(--color-primary); text-decoration: none; }
      .header-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }
      .btn-get-started {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        background: var(--color-primary-container);
        color: var(--color-on-primary-container);
        padding: 8px 24px;
        border: none;
        border-radius: var(--radius-default);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .btn-get-started:hover {
        transform: scale(1.05);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      /* ── Hero ── */
      .hero {
        position: relative;
        min-height: 90vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        overflow: hidden;
        padding-top: 96px;
      }
      .hero-grid {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background-image:
          linear-gradient(rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
          linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
        background-size: 40px 40px;
        opacity: 0.3;
        z-index: 0;
      }
      .hero-content {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        gap: 48px;
        padding: 48px 0;
      }
      .hero-logo-wrapper {
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 500px;
      }
      .hero-logo-glow {
        position: absolute;
        inset: -16px;
        background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.2);
        filter: blur(100px);
        border-radius: 50%;
      }
      .hero-logo {
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
        z-index: 1;
        filter: brightness(1.1) drop-shadow(0 25px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5));
      }
      .hero-headline {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
        line-height: 1.15;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        color: var(--color-primary);
        text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(71, 214, 255, 0.5);
      }
      .hero-subtitle {
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 28px;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        max-width: 700px;
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
      }
      .hero-buttons {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 16px;
      }
      .btn-primary {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        background: var(--color-primary-container);
        color: var(--color-on-primary-container);
        padding: 16px 32px;
        border: none;
        border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 16px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: box-shadow 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .btn-primary:hover {
        box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.3);
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .btn-secondary {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.3);
        background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.05);
        color: var(--color-text);
        padding: 16px 32px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 16px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background 0.3s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .btn-secondary:hover {
        background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.1);
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .hero-stats {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 24px;
        padding-top: 16px;
      }
      .stat-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
      .stat-value {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 24px;
        line-height: 32px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--color-primary);
      }
      .stat-label {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 500;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        color: var(--color-outline);
      }
      .stat-divider {
        width: 1px;
        height: 40px;
        background: rgba(133, 147, 153, 0.2);
      }

      /* ── Feedback Loop ── */
      .feedback-section { background: var(--color-surface); }
      .feedback-image-frame {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 48px auto 0;
        border-radius: var(--radius-3xl);
        overflow: hidden;
        padding: 16px;
      }
      .feedback-image-frame img {
        width: 100%;
        border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      }

      /* ── Feedback Steps ── */
      .feedback-steps {
        margin-top: 64px;
        max-width: 1000px;
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
        column-gap: 24px;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .feedback-steps { columns: 2; }
      }
      .feedback-step {
        padding: 32px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
        break-inside: avoid;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .feedback-step-number {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 32px;
        height: 32px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.15);
        color: var(--color-primary);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }
      .feedback-step h4 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }
      .feedback-step p {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 24px;
      }
      .feedback-step ul {
        list-style: none;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
        margin-top: 12px;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .feedback-step ul li {
        position: relative;
        padding-left: 16px;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 24px;
      }
      .feedback-step ul li::before {
        content: '\2022';
        color: var(--color-primary);
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
      }
      .feedback-step ul li strong {
        color: var(--color-text);
      }

      /* ── Agent Roles ── */
      .roles-section { background: var(--color-surface-lowest); position: relative; }
      .roles-grid-bg {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        opacity: 0.1;
        pointer-events: none;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .roles-grid-bg-inner {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
        height: 100%;
      }
      .roles-grid-bg-inner > div { border-right: 1px solid rgba(133, 147, 153, 0.2); }
      .roles-image-frame {
        position: relative;
        border-radius: var(--radius-3xl);
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.2);
        margin-bottom: 64px;
      }
      .roles-image-frame img { width: 100%; }
      .roles-image-frame.glass-panel {
        background: none;
        backdrop-filter: none;
      }
      .roles-cards {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: var(--space-gutter);
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .roles-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      }
      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .roles-cards { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
      }
      .role-card {
        padding: 32px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      .role-card--designer { box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(176, 122, 237, 0.25), 0 0 4px rgba(176, 122, 237, 0.15); }
      .role-card--developer { box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(106, 191, 75, 0.25), 0 0 4px rgba(106, 191, 75, 0.15); }
      .role-card--plugin { box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(212, 149, 46, 0.25), 0 0 4px rgba(212, 149, 46, 0.15); }
      .role-card--devops { box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(91, 140, 201, 0.25), 0 0 4px rgba(91, 140, 201, 0.15); }
      .role-icon {
        width: 80px;
        height: 80px;
        object-fit: contain;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .role-card h4 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 24px;
        line-height: 32px;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }
      .role-card p {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
      }

      /* ── Plugins ── */
      .plugins-section { background: var(--color-surface); }
      .plugins-layout {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 64px;
        align-items: center;
      }
      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .plugins-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      }
      .plugins-image-frame {
        border-radius: var(--radius-3xl);
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.2);
      }
      .plugins-image-frame img { width: 100%; }
      .plugins-text h2 { margin-bottom: 24px; }
      .plugins-tagline {
        font-style: italic;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 28px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .plugins-body {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 26px;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
      }
      .plugins-features { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; padding: 0; }
      .plugins-features li {
        position: relative;
        padding-left: 16px;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        line-height: 24px;
      }
      .plugins-features li::before {
        content: '\2022';
        color: var(--color-primary);
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
      }
      .plugins-features li strong { color: var(--color-text); }

      /* ── Contract ── */
      .contract-section { }
      .contract-layout {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 64px;
        align-items: center;
      }
      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .contract-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      }
      .contract-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.1);
        color: var(--color-primary);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 500;
        padding: 4px 12px;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .contract-text h2 { margin-bottom: 24px; }
      .contract-text p {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 28px;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
      }
      .contract-checklist { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; padding: 0; }
      .contract-checklist li {
        position: relative;
        padding-left: 16px;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        line-height: 24px;
      }
      .contract-checklist li::before {
        content: '\2022';
        color: var(--color-primary);
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
      }

      /* Code tabs */
      .code-panel {
        border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.3);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        height: 520px;
      }
      .code-tabs {
        display: flex;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.3);
        background: var(--color-surface-low);
      }
      .code-tab {
        padding: 16px 24px;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        border: none;
        background: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
        transition: color 0.2s;
      }
      .code-tab:hover { color: var(--color-primary); }
      .code-panel-content {
        display: none;
        flex: 1;
        padding: 24px;
        background: var(--color-surface-lowest);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 19px;
        overflow: auto;
        color: var(--color-secondary-dim);
      }
      .code-line {
        white-space: pre;
        min-height: 19px;
      }
      .cb::before { content: '{'; }
      .ce::before { content: '}'; }
      #code-tab-contract:checked ~ .code-tabs label[for="code-tab-contract"],
      #code-tab-html:checked ~ .code-tabs label[for="code-tab-html"],
      #code-tab-types:checked ~ .code-tabs label[for="code-tab-types"],
      #code-tab-component:checked ~ .code-tabs label[for="code-tab-component"] {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        border-bottom-color: var(--color-primary);
      }
      #code-tab-contract:checked ~ .code-panels #panel-contract,
      #code-tab-html:checked ~ .code-panels #panel-html,
      #code-tab-types:checked ~ .code-panels #panel-types,
      #code-tab-component:checked ~ .code-panels #panel-component {
        display: block;
      }

      /* ── Full Stack ── */
      .fullstack-section {
        background: #0A0F1E;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .fullstack-image {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        margin-bottom: 64px;
      }
      .fullstack-image img {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 600px;
        filter: drop-shadow(0 0 50px rgba(255, 170, 0, 0.2));
      }
      /* Vertical tabs for layers */
      .fullstack-tabs { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }
      .fullstack-tabs input[type="radio"] { display: none; }
      .fullstack-tabs-inner {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .fullstack-tabs-inner { flex-direction: row; }
      }
      .fullstack-tab-nav {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: row;
        overflow-x: auto;
        gap: 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.3);
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .fullstack-tab-nav {
          flex-direction: column;
          flex-shrink: 0;
          width: 240px;
          border-bottom: none;
          border-right: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.3);
          overflow-x: visible;
        }
      }
      .fullstack-tab-label {
        display: block;
        padding: 16px 24px;
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        cursor: pointer;
        border-left: 3px solid transparent;
        transition: color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .fullstack-tab-label:hover {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.03);
      }
      .fullstack-tab-panels {
        flex: 1;
        min-height: 200px;
      }
      .fullstack-tab-panel {
        display: none;
        padding: 24px 32px;
      }
      .fullstack-tab-panel h4 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 22px;
        line-height: 30px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--color-primary);
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }
      .fullstack-tab-panel p {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 26px;
      }
      /* Tab checked states */
      #fs-tab-1:checked ~ .fullstack-tabs-inner .fullstack-tab-nav label[for="fs-tab-1"],
      #fs-tab-2:checked ~ .fullstack-tabs-inner .fullstack-tab-nav label[for="fs-tab-2"],
      #fs-tab-3:checked ~ .fullstack-tabs-inner .fullstack-tab-nav label[for="fs-tab-3"],
      #fs-tab-4:checked ~ .fullstack-tabs-inner .fullstack-tab-nav label[for="fs-tab-4"],
      #fs-tab-5:checked ~ .fullstack-tabs-inner .fullstack-tab-nav label[for="fs-tab-5"] {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.05);
        border-left-color: var(--color-primary);
      }
      #fs-tab-1:checked ~ .fullstack-tabs-inner .fullstack-tab-panels #fs-panel-1,
      #fs-tab-2:checked ~ .fullstack-tabs-inner .fullstack-tab-panels #fs-panel-2,
      #fs-tab-3:checked ~ .fullstack-tabs-inner .fullstack-tab-panels #fs-panel-3,
      #fs-tab-4:checked ~ .fullstack-tabs-inner .fullstack-tab-panels #fs-panel-4,
      #fs-tab-5:checked ~ .fullstack-tabs-inner .fullstack-tab-panels #fs-panel-5 {
        display: block;
      }

      /* ── Real-World Value (Bento Grid) ── */
      .value-section { }
      .bento-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 24px;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .bento-grid {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
          grid-template-rows: auto auto;
          min-height: 600px;
        }
        .bento-wide { grid-column: span 2; }
        .bento-tall { grid-row: span 2; }
      }
      .bento-card {
        padding: 40px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-3xl);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      .bento-card--performance {
        position: relative;
      }
      .bento-card--performance .bento-icon-corner {
        position: relative;
      }
      .bento-card--performance .bento-icon-corner img {
        opacity: 0.85;
        transition: opacity 0.3s;
      }
      .bento-card--performance:hover .bento-icon-corner img {
        opacity: 1;
      }
      .lighthouse-hint {
        position: absolute;
        top: 100%;
        right: 0;
        padding-top: 8px;
        opacity: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        transition: opacity 0.2s;
        z-index: 2;
      }
      .lighthouse-hint-inner {
        padding: 8px 14px;
        background: var(--color-surface-high);
        border: 1px solid rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.2);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 18px;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .lighthouse-hint a {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
      .bento-icon-corner:hover .lighthouse-hint {
        opacity: 1;
        pointer-events: auto;
      }
      .bento-card--visual-editor {
        justify-content: space-between;
      }
      .bento-card--risk {
        gap: 16px;
      }
      .bento-card--assembly {
        gap: 16px;
      }
      .bento-icon { font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
      .bento-card h3 { margin-bottom: 16px; }

      .bento-features {
        list-style: none;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-top: 16px;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .bento-features li {
        position: relative;
        padding-left: 16px;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 24px;
      }
      .bento-features li::before {
        content: '\2022';
        color: var(--color-primary);
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
      }
      .bento-features li strong {
        color: var(--color-text);
      }

      /* ── CTA ── */
      .cta-section { padding: 96px 0; }
      .cta-box {
        padding: 64px;
        border-radius: 2rem;
        border: 2px solid rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.2);
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .cta-glow-tl {
        position: absolute;
        top: -96px; left: -96px;
        width: 256px; height: 256px;
        background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.2);
        border-radius: 50%;
        filter: blur(48px);
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .cta-glow-br {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: -96px; right: -96px;
        width: 256px; height: 256px;
        background: rgba(0, 244, 254, 0.1);
        border-radius: 50%;
        filter: blur(48px);
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .cta-box h2 { margin-bottom: 32px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
      .cta-buttons {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 16px;
        justify-content: center;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }
      @media (min-width: 640px) {
        .cta-buttons { flex-direction: row; }
      }
      .btn-cta-primary {
        background: var(--color-primary-container);
        color: var(--color-on-primary-container);
        padding: 20px 40px;
        border: none;
        border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 18px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: transform 0.2s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .btn-cta-primary:hover { transform: scale(1.05); text-decoration: none; }
      .btn-cta-secondary {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        color: var(--color-text);
        padding: 20px 40px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 18px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background 0.3s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .btn-cta-secondary:hover {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      /* ── Footer ── */
      .site-footer {
        background: var(--color-surface-lowest);
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.2);
        padding: 48px 0;
      }
      .footer-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: var(--space-gutter);
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      }
      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 2fr; }
      }
      .footer-brand {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--color-primary);
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .footer-copyright {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        line-height: 16px;
      }
      .footer-heading {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .footer-links { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
      .footer-links a {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        transition: color 0.3s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--color-secondary-dim); text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="page-root">

    <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <!-- Header                                      -->
    <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <header class="site-header">
      <nav class="header-inner">
        <a href="/" class="header-brand">Jay Framework</a>
        <div class="header-nav">
          <a href="#feedback-loop">Ecosystem</a>
          <a href="#agent-roles">Agents</a>
          <a href="#contract">The Contract</a>
          <a href="#full-stack">Full Stack</a>
          <a href="#value">Performance</a>
        </div>
        <div class="header-actions">
          <a class="btn-get-started" href="#cta">Get Started</a>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>

      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <!-- Hero                                        -->
      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-grid"></div>
        <div class="container">
          <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="hero-logo-wrapper">
              <div class="hero-logo-glow"></div>
              <img class="hero-logo" src="/Jay Logo 2.png" alt="Jay Framework Logo">
            </div>
            <div>
              <h1 class="hero-headline">The self-correcting visual ecosystem for AI-native web development.</h1>
              <p class="hero-subtitle" style="margin-top: 32px;">Jay bridges the gap between probabilistic AI outputs and deterministic engineering standards. Through Jay's development-time feedback loop and the visual AIditor, the platform immediately validates agent actions, promotes smart code reuse, and enables seamless visual editing to ensure code is 100% production-ready before deployment.</p>
              <div class="hero-buttons" style="margin-top: 32px;">
                <a class="btn-primary" href="#cta">Initialize Project</a>
                <a class="btn-secondary" href="https://github.com/nicenathapong/jay-framework">View on GitHub</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <!-- The Jay Feedback Loop                       -->
      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <section id="feedback-loop" class="section feedback-section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="text-center">
            <span class="section-label">Core Architecture</span>
            <h2 class="headline-lg" style="margin-top: 16px;">The Jay Feedback Loop</h2>
            <p class="headline-sm text-muted" style="margin-top: 16px; max-width: 800px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">Guiding AI to guaranteed, production-ready results through continuous validation and strict boundaries.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feedback-image-frame glass-panel">
            <img src="/feedback loop.png" alt="Jay Feedback Loop Diagram — showing the self-correcting cycle of AI agents, declarative code, validation, and error feedback">
          </div>

          <div class="feedback-steps">
            <div class="feedback-step glass-panel">
              <div class="feedback-step-number">1</div>
              <h4>The AI Agent (Generator)</h4>
              <p>The cycle begins with specialized AI roles (Designer, Developer, or Plugin Developer) reading the explicitly defined contracts and instructions. Because the boundaries are clear, the agent knows exactly what data it has to work with and what it needs to build.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feedback-step glass-panel">
              <div class="feedback-step-number">2</div>
              <h4>Declarative Code &amp; Logic (Output)</h4>
              <p>The AI outputs the code, adhering to Jay's strict separation of design and logic.</p>
              <ul>
                <li>The <strong>AI Designer</strong> generates purely declarative, logic-free visual templates (.jay-html), utilizing functionality from plugins.</li>
                <li>If custom functionality is needed, the <strong>AI Developer</strong> outputs the application logic in page.ts. This separation ensures agents can iterate on the UI without ever breaking the backend code.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="feedback-step glass-panel">
              <div class="feedback-step-number">3</div>
              <h4>Validation Engine (Gatekeeper)</h4>
              <p>Jay doesn't let the AI guess if its code works; it automatically acts as a strict inspection node. The framework evaluates the agent's output using comprehensive tools:</p>
              <ul>
                <li><strong>jay-stack validate:</strong> Checks for parsing and contract matching errors.</li>
                <li><strong>Tag Coverage Report:</strong> Analyzes the HTML tree to tell the AI exactly which contract tags were used, which were missed, and if any required tags were omitted.</li>
                <li><strong>TypeScript Compiler (TSC):</strong> Validates the backend logic against the auto-generated, phase-specific .d.ts types.</li>
                <li><strong>Plugin Validation:</strong> Ensures consistency between plugin.yaml configurations and component properties.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="feedback-step glass-panel">
              <div class="feedback-step-number">4</div>
              <h4>Errors + Agent-Kit References (Feedback)</h4>
              <p>If the code fails validation, the system doesn't just output a generic error. It provides an explicit path forward by pointing the agent directly back to the Agent-Kit's ground truth, referencing materialized contracts, the plugins-index.yaml, and specific Agent-Kit guides so the AI can self-correct with exact context.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <!-- Agent Roles                                 -->
      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <section id="agent-roles" class="section roles-section">
        <div class="roles-grid-bg">
          <div class="roles-grid-bg-inner">
            <div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div>
            <div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="container" style="position: relative; z-index: 1;">
          <div style="margin-bottom: 64px;">
            <h2 class="headline-lg">Defined Agent Roles</h2>
            <p class="body-lg text-muted" style="margin-top: 16px;">Each agent within Jay is fine-tuned for specialized operations in the stack.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="roles-image-frame glass-panel">
            <img src="/AI Roles 3.png" alt="Jay Framework Agent Roles — Designer, Developer, Plugin Developer, and DevOps">
          </div>
          <div class="roles-cards">
            <div class="role-card glass-panel role-card--designer">
              <img class="role-icon" src="/designer spider icon.png" alt="AI Designer">
              <h4>Designer</h4>
              <p>Generates purely declarative, logic-free visual templates by mapping contract data directly to the UI, turning visual references into working designs.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="role-card glass-panel role-card--developer">
              <img class="role-icon" src="/developer spider icon.png" alt="AI Developer">
              <h4>Developer</h4>
              <p>Builds the full-stack application logic and data flow required to satisfy the strict contracts, completely unburdened from writing HTML or CSS.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="role-card glass-panel role-card--plugin">
              <img class="role-icon" src="/plugin developer spider icon.png" alt="AI Plugin Developer">
              <h4>Plugin Developer</h4>
              <p>Packages extensible, reusable business logic and headless components into installable plugins.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="role-card glass-panel role-card--devops">
              <img class="role-icon" src="/devops spider icon.png" alt="AI DevOps">
              <h4>DevOps</h4>
              <p>Manages the deployment lifecycle, overseeing the Two-Server Architecture and caching infrastructure for lightning-fast, zero-downtime updates.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <!-- Plugins                                     -->
      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <section id="plugins" class="section plugins-section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="plugins-layout">
            <div class="plugins-image-frame glass-panel">
              <img src="/Jay Framework Plugins.png" alt="Jay Framework Plugins — installable NPM packages with headless components, actions, and contracts">
            </div>
            <div class="plugins-text">
              <span class="section-label">Ecosystem</span>
              <h2 class="headline-lg" style="margin-top: 16px;">Plugins</h2>
              <p class="plugins-tagline">Why force AI to hallucinate complex business logic from scratch? Just like human developers, AI agents favor reusing code.</p>
              <p class="plugins-body">Reusing battle-tested, pre-packaged capabilities reduces bugs, token costs, and maintenance overhead while improving accuracy and performance. Jay enables this through Plugins - installable NPM packages bundling headless components, server actions, and explicit data contracts.</p>
              <ul class="plugins-features">
                <li><strong>Zero-Coding Integration:</strong> AI agents can drop complex features into a project instantly. The Designer simply maps plugin data contracts directly to the visual UI.</li>
                <li><strong>Reducing Non-Functional Risk:</strong> Reusing established plugins means your project inherits optimal performance, robust security, and built-in SEO capabilities.</li>
                <li><strong>Zero Trust Architecture:</strong> Jay executes plugin code safely in an isolated sandbox, ensuring external components can never access the host site's main DOM or secure cookies.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <!-- The Contract                                -->
      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <section id="contract" class="section contract-section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="contract-layout">
            <div class="contract-text">
              <span class="contract-badge">THE .JAY-CONTRACT</span>
              <h2 class="headline-lg">Independent Iteration. Absolute Fidelity.</h2>
              <p>At the heart of Jay is the .jay-contract, a strict, declarative agreement that allows AI agents to work together without stepping on each other's toes.</p>
              <ul class="contract-checklist">
                <li>Strong typing generated from the contract.</li>
                <li>The Designer agent creates Jay HTML files.</li>
                <li>The Developer or Plugin Developer agents code the components.</li>
                <li>Independent iteration — redesign UI without rewriting backend logic.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="code-panel glass-panel">
              <input type="radio" name="code-tab" id="code-tab-contract" checked hidden>
              <input type="radio" name="code-tab" id="code-tab-html" hidden>
              <input type="radio" name="code-tab" id="code-tab-types" hidden>
              <input type="radio" name="code-tab" id="code-tab-component" hidden>
              <div class="code-tabs">
                <label for="code-tab-contract" class="code-tab">Contract</label>
                <label for="code-tab-html" class="code-tab">Jay HTML</label>
                <label for="code-tab-types" class="code-tab">Types</label>
                <label for="code-tab-component" class="code-tab">Component</label>
              </div>
              <div class="code-panels">
                <div class="code-panel-content" id="panel-contract">
                  <div class="code-line">props:</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp; - name: text</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; kind: required</div>
                  <div class="code-line">tags:</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp; - tag: text</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; type: data</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; dataType: string</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; phase: fast+interactive</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp; - tag: copied</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; type: data</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; dataType: boolean</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; phase: fast+interactive</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp; - tag: copyBtn</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; type: interactive</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; elementType: HTMLButtonElement</div>
                </div>
                <div class="code-panel-content" id="panel-html">
                  <div class="code-line">&lt;!-- nested headless component --&gt;</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&lt;jay:clipboard-copy text="..."&gt;</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp; &lt;div class="copy-row"&gt;</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &lt;div class="copy-url"&gt;</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; the text tag renders here</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &lt;/div&gt;</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &lt;button ref="copyBtn"&gt;</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &lt;span if="!copied"&gt;Copy Link&lt;/span&gt;</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &lt;span if="copied"&gt;Copied!&lt;/span&gt;</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &lt;/button&gt;</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp; &lt;/div&gt;</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&lt;/jay:clipboard-copy&gt;</div>
                </div>
                <div class="code-panel-content" id="panel-types">
                  <div class="code-line">export interface ClipboardCopyViewState <span class="cb"></span></div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; text: string;</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; copied: boolean;</div>
                  <div class="code-line"><span class="ce"></span></div>
                  <div class="code-line">export interface ClipboardCopyRefs <span class="cb"></span></div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; copyBtn: HTMLElementProxy&lt;ClipboardCopyViewState, HTMLButtonElement&gt;;</div>
                  <div class="code-line"><span class="ce"></span></div>
                  <div class="code-line">export interface ClipboardCopyProps <span class="cb"></span></div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; text?: string;</div>
                  <div class="code-line"><span class="ce"></span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="code-panel-content" id="panel-component">
                  <div class="code-line">export const clipboardCopy = makeJayStackComponent&lt;ClipboardCopyContract&gt;()</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; .withProps&lt;ClipboardCopyProps&gt;()</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; .withFastRender(async (props) =&gt;</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; phaseOutput(<span class="cb"></span> text: props.text ?? '', copied: false <span class="ce"></span>, <span class="cb"></span><span class="ce"></span>),</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; )</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; .withInteractive(function ClipboardCopy(props, refs) <span class="cb"></span></div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; const [copied, setCopied] = createSignal(false);</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; refs.copyBtn.onclick(async () =&gt; <span class="cb"></span></div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; await navigator.clipboard.writeText(props.text());</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; setCopied(true);</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; setTimeout(() =&gt; setCopied(false), 2000);</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span class="ce"></span>);</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; return <span class="cb"></span> render: () =&gt; (<span class="cb"></span> text: props.text(), copied: copied() <span class="ce"></span>) <span class="ce"></span>;</div>
                  <div class="code-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span class="ce"></span>);</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <!-- Full Stack of Solutions                     -->
      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <section id="full-stack" class="section fullstack-section">
        <div class="container text-center" style="margin-bottom: 64px;">
          <h2 class="headline-lg" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">The Full Stack of Solutions</h2>
          <p class="body-lg text-muted" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">From initial concept to lightning-fast, production-ready deployments through a comprehensive, AI-native infrastructure.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="container">
          <div class="fullstack-image">
            <img src="/full stack of solutions 2.png" alt="Jay Full Stack of Solutions — five layers from contracts to AIditor">
          </div>
          <div class="fullstack-tabs glass-panel" style="border-radius: var(--radius-2xl); overflow: hidden;">
            <input type="radio" name="fs-tab" id="fs-tab-1" checked hidden>
            <input type="radio" name="fs-tab" id="fs-tab-2" hidden>
            <input type="radio" name="fs-tab" id="fs-tab-3" hidden>
            <input type="radio" name="fs-tab" id="fs-tab-4" hidden>
            <input type="radio" name="fs-tab" id="fs-tab-5" hidden>
            <div class="fullstack-tabs-inner">
              <div class="fullstack-tab-nav">
                <label for="fs-tab-1" class="fullstack-tab-label">1. The Foundation</label>
                <label for="fs-tab-2" class="fullstack-tab-label">2. Jay Framework</label>
                <label for="fs-tab-3" class="fullstack-tab-label">3. Jay Stack</label>
                <label for="fs-tab-4" class="fullstack-tab-label">4. Plugins</label>
                <label for="fs-tab-5" class="fullstack-tab-label">5. The Jay AIditor</label>
              </div>
              <div class="fullstack-tab-panels">
                <div class="fullstack-tab-panel" id="fs-panel-1">
                  <h4>The Feedback Loop &amp; Contracts</h4>
                  <p>The foundation of the ecosystem is the .jay-contract, establishing a strict boundary that completely decouples visual design templates (.jay-html) from backend application logic (page.ts). This separation powers a self-correcting feedback loop: an automated Validation Engine rigorously inspects AI-generated code, returning explicit, context-rich errors that guide agents back to the ground truth to guarantee high-quality results.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="fullstack-tab-panel" id="fs-panel-2">
                  <h4>Jay Framework</h4>
                  <p>A minimal, highly optimized client-side framework (roughly 1,200 lines of code) built specifically for contracts and AI agents. It relies on fine-grained reactive and immutable data, and enforces security by default through an architecture that safely executes logic-free "Jay Elements" on the main thread while isolating potentially untrusted 3rd-party component logic within a secure sandbox.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="fullstack-tab-panel" id="fs-panel-3">
                  <h4>Jay Stack</h4>
                  <p>The full-stack web framework that takes Jay to production, engineered around a strict three-phase rendering model: Slow (build-time / SSG), Fast (request-time / SSR), and Interactive (client-side). This guarantees that even the most dynamic, AI-generated applications ship with sub-second load times, predictable request latency, and perfect SEO compatibility.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="fullstack-tab-panel" id="fs-panel-4">
                  <h4>Plugins</h4>
                  <p>Acting as an ecosystem multiplier, Plugins are installable NPM packages that bundle headless components, server actions, services, and explicit contracts. By reusing these battle-tested packages, AI agents can instantly drop complex functionalities (like a storefront or a CMS) into a page without having to hallucinate logic from scratch, vastly reducing bugs, computing costs, and long-term maintenance overhead.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="fullstack-tab-panel" id="fs-panel-5">
                  <h4>The Jay AIditor</h4>
                  <p>The ultimate "AI-first" visual creation tool, built entirely as a Jay plugin. The AIditor allows users to upload a screenshot or paste a live URL and instantly convert it into a working, contract-bound Jay website. Editing is done through a seamless "point-and-shoot" experience that feels like a natural human review process, eliminating the need for complex side-panels, property inspectors, or manual element selection.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <!-- Real-World Value (Bento Grid)               -->
      <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <section id="value" class="section value-section">
        <div class="container">
          <h2 class="headline-lg text-center" style="margin-bottom: 48px;">Real-World Value</h2>
          <div class="bento-grid">
            <!-- Visual Editor — wide -->
            <div class="bento-card glass-panel bento-wide bento-card--visual-editor">
              <div>
                <h3 class="headline-md">Claude as a Visual Editor</h3>
                <img src="/aiditor.png" alt="Jay AIditor — visual editing interface" style="max-width: 400px; width: 100%; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); margin: 16px 0;">
                <p class="body-lg text-muted">The Jay AIditor transforms AI interaction into an intuitive "point and shoot" visual experience. Without any complex side-panels or manual selections, you simply point at an element and let the AI execute updates directly on the application / website code.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Performance — tall -->
            <div class="bento-card glass-panel bento-tall bento-card--performance">
              <div>
                <h3 class="headline-md">Near-Perfect Performance</h3>
                <div class="bento-icon-corner" style="position: relative; top: auto; right: auto; margin: 16px 0;">
                  <img src="/lighthouse.png" alt="Lighthouse perfect scores" style="width: 200px; height: auto;">
                  <div class="lighthouse-hint"><div class="lighthouse-hint-inner">measured on the <a href="https://jay-onsko-52654f57-yoav68.wix-site-host.com/" target="_blank">Jay Onsko Template</a></div></div>
                </div>
                <p class="body-md text-muted">Jay is engineered from the ground up to ensure every site ships with minimal bundle sizes, lightning-fast load times, and top-tier Lighthouse scores out of the box.</p>
                <ul class="bento-features">
                  <li><strong>3-Phase Rendering Pipeline:</strong> Strict separation of design and logic yields minimal bundle sizes and smooth 60 FPS performance for flawless SEO.</li>
                  <li><strong>Automated Guardrails:</strong> Built-in AI feedback loops continuously monitor code generation, automatically catching common performance traps and heavy assets before deployment.</li>
                  <li><strong>Wix Media Optimization</strong> (provided by wix-media plugin): Automatic image formatting, responsive sizing, CDN and asset optimization ensure ultra-fast media delivery.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Lower Costs & Maintenance -->
            <div class="bento-card glass-panel bento-card--risk">
              <h4 class="headline-sm">Radically Lower Costs &amp; Maintenance</h4>
              <p class="body-md text-muted">By reusing secure, pre-packaged code, AI agents avoid re-implementing core logic. This eliminates bugs, security flaws, and performance drops while drastically cutting token costs and maintenance overhead.</p>
            </div>
            <!-- Zero-Coding Assembly -->
            <div class="bento-card glass-panel bento-card--assembly">
              <h4 class="headline-sm">Zero-Coding App Assembly</h4>
              <p class="body-md text-muted">Agents instantly build full-stack apps by dropping in battle-tested Jay Plugins (NPM packages). They map data contracts directly to the visual UI—no manual wiring, prop-drilling, or coding required.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

